     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi ,</span><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">I&#39;m trying to call method from our package written in R something like below:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">******************</span></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><span>\t</span> ListVector <span>r</span>= (ListVector)</p><p><span>engine</span>.eval(<span>&quot;signal_denoise2(&quot;</span>+ <span>ecgVect</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>ppgVect</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>opVect</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>ppg1Vect</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p><span>\t</span><span>\t</span><span>\t</span><span>\t</span><span>\t</span>+ <span>cal_sp</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>cal_dp</span>+ <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>cal_ptt</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>cal_hr</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>Fs</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p><span>\t</span><span>\t</span><span>\t</span><span>\t</span><span>\t</span>+ <span>Fs_resp</span> + <span>&quot;,&quot;</span> + <span>cal_flag</span> + <span>&quot;)&quot;</span>);</p></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">*********************</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">However , I&#39;m getting below Exception. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">I use same way to parse the input values using Rengine and it works fine. Could you pleas take a look??</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><p>Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; <span>org.renjin.parser.ParseException</span>: Syntax error at line 2 char 254575: syntax error, unexpected &#39;,&#39;, expecting &#39;\\n&#39; or &#39;;&#39;</p><p><br></p><p><span></span>at org.renjin.parser.RParser.parseAll(<span>RParser.java:148</span>)</p><p><span></span>at org.renjin.parser.RParser.parseSource(<span>RParser.java:75</span>)</p><p><span></span>at org.renjin.parser.RParser.parseSource(<span>RParser.java:121</span>)</p><p><span></span>at org.renjin.parser.RParser.parseSource(<span>RParser.java:128</span>)</p><p><span></span>at org.renjin.script.RenjinScriptEngine.eval(<span>RenjinScriptEngine.java:109</span>)</p><p><span></span>at com.dynosense.Renjin.Renjin1.test(<span>Renjin1.java:121</span>)</p><p><span></span>at com.dynosense.Renjin.Renjin1.main(<span>Renjin1.java:135</span>)</p></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks &amp; Regards,</p><p>Sindhu</p></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
