    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m not sure what the type of egcVect and the other arguments are, but it&#39;s likely that whatever value return by egcVect.toString() is not valid R syntax.<div><br></div><div>Instead of trying to mash together an R script (which looks to be in excess of 254k), you should use the Script API for passing R objects directly to the engine:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"overflow:auto;font-family:Incosolata,Consolata,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;padding:12px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;background:rgb(246,245,245)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"color:teal\">put</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;x&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">);</span><font color=\"#404040\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"color:teal\">put</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;y&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">new</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(68,85,136);font-weight:bold\">double</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">[]</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">{</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">d</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">});</span><font color=\"#404040\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"color:teal\">put</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;z&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">new</span><font color=\"#404040\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">DoubleArrayVector</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold\">));</span><font color=\"#404040\">\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font color=\"#404040\">.</font><font color=\"#008080\">eval(&quot;x + y + z&quot;);</font></span></pre></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">See <a href=\"http://docs.renjin.org/en/latest/moving-data-between-java-and-r-code.html#pushing-data-from-java-to-r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.renjin.org/en/latest/moving-data-between-java-and-r-code.html%23pushing-data-from-java-to-r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343747116000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3m6gp5j60wxMhcvmYRjHhX\">Pushing data from Java to R</a> on <a href=\"http://docs.renjin.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.renjin.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343747116000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28f8YcLp3s5TG2JD-cVkrQ\">docs.renjin.org</a> for more examples.</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">Alex</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
